node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.nx
**/dist
**/build
.expo
**/.expo
*.log
.env
.env.local
packages/rab-mobile
# Documentation site (Mintlify) — media-heavy and not part of the server image.
packages/rab-docs

# Never send local secrets to the build context (nested packages too). Phase B: this includes .env.migrate (the one-off
# rab-migrate credential) and .env.ops (the retired rab-ops environment; a leftover file may still hold old credentials),
# which must never reach an image layer.
.env*
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Final review F6: Nx also loads .local.env and .<target>[.local].env (nx-dotenv-files.ts).
.*.env
**/.*.env
!**/.env.example
.audit

# H3: local Yarn state and caches (the images resolve dependencies from yarn.lock in their own stages; a developer's
# install state must not steer `yarn workspaces focus`), local agent/editor configuration, and test/coverage output.
# Nothing here is needed to build; none of it reaches a runtime image (the final stages copy only named dist folders).
.yarn/install-state.gz
.yarn/build-state.yml
.yarn/cache
.yarn/unplugged
.claude
.agents
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
